# Line endings are part of the engineering baseline. AGENTS.md requires UTF-8,
# LF endings, four spaces, and a final newline for repository text, but that
# rule was unenforceable while checkout depended on each contributor's
# core.autocrlf setting. Declaring it here makes the working tree deterministic
# on every platform, so scripts/lint.py can check working-tree bytes honestly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# lineage/ holds immutable attributed evidence whose sha256 digests are
# verified byte-for-byte against lineage/SOURCES.lock by
# scripts/verify_bootstrap.py. No end-of-line conversion may touch it.
lineage/** -text
